{"overview":"آنوس ولدیگورد پادشاه شیطانی ستمگری بود که انسان‌ها، ارواح و حتی خدایان را نابود کرد، اما از جنگ ابدی خسته شد و با رؤیای جهانی صلح‌آمیز تجسد دوباره یافت. پس از ۲۰۰۰ سال، او در تجسد با نوادگانی مواجه می‌شود که پس از عادت به صلح، بسیار ضعیف شده‌اند و جادوهایی که به شدت تخریب شده‌اند. آنوس به آکادمی پادشاه شیطان می‌پیوندد؛ جایی که کسانی که به عنوان تجسد پادشاه شیطان شناخته می‌شوند آموزش می‌بینند، اما آکادمی نتوانست قدرت واقعی او را درک کند و او را به‌عنوان یک ناهمخوان برچسب زد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Anos Voldigord was a tyrannical Demon King that eradicated humans, spirits, and even the gods, but became bored of eternal warfare and reincarnated with dreams of a peaceful world. However, what awaited him in reincarnation after 2000 years were descendants who became too weak after being accustomed to peace, and all sorts of magic that deteriorated to the extreme. Anos enters Demon King Academy that gathers and educates those who are viewed as the reincarnation of the Demon King, but the academy could not see through his true powers and ends up branding him as a misfit.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2020,"poster":"/eVJyT5RJ4xNsxs4y0SbrJa3LKif.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2023,"poster":"/lldncM2Lj72WvJ9eZkyNjQcNZRs.jpg"}],"episodes":37,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"楠木ともり","role":"Misha Necron (voice)","photo":"/iiGJPsLAnOoqmkNjLWCvbbDJw50.jpg","en":"Tomori Kusunoki"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Anos Voldigoad (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"夏吉ゆうこ","role":"Sasha Necron (voice)","photo":"/62JhZDG70JAzht71e1B0Y7Ny14r.jpg","en":"Yuko Natsuyoshi"},{"name":"寺島拓篤","role":"Lay Glanzudlii (voice)","photo":"/n5uCihb318AzQCT9gieMlI2ueYL.jpg","en":"Takuma Terashima"},{"name":"稗田寧々","role":"Misa Ilioroagu (voice)","photo":"/kg2cNTQ83bDadVBPJSrY2quRQpT.jpg","en":"Nene Hieda"},{"name":"渡部紗弓","role":"Eleonore Bianca (vo